   "fen": "r1bqk1nr/pppp1ppp/2n5/2b1N3/4P3/2N5/PPPP1PPP/R1BQKB1R b KQkq - 0 4",
   "line": [
    "Nxe5"
   ],
   "spoken": "The knight takes on e5 — the center fork trick, a theme that recurs across many openings, and your reaction should be automatic.",
