   "fen": "r1bqk1nr/pppp1ppp/3b4/4n3/3PP3/2N5/PPP2PPP/R1BQKB1R w KQkq - 1 6",
   "line": [
    "Bd6"
   ],
   "spoken": "The bishop to d6 is the ONLY move that keeps Black's bishop pair and a viable position — everything else loses quickly or is much worse.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
    "...Bd6 is forced to keep the bishops"
   ]
  },
  {
   "ply": 11,
   "t": 94.5,
   "fen": "r1bqk1nr/pppp1ppp/3b4/4P3/4P3/2N5/PPP2PPP/R1BQKB1R b KQkq - 0 6",
