   "fen": "r1bqk1nr/pppp1ppp/8/4b3/4P3/2N5/PPP2PPP/R1BQKB1R w KQkq - 0 7",
   "line": [
    "Bxe5"
   ],
   "spoken": "After the trades White is clearly better — three pieces clamp the d5 square, and the bishop on e5 is an awkward, vulnerable piece.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
    "d5 control + a loose enemy bishop"
   ]
  },
  {
   "ply": 13,
   "t": 200.5,
   "fen": "r1bqk1nr/pppp1ppp/8/4b3/4P3/2NB4/PPP2PPP/R1BQK2R b KQkq - 1 7",
   "line": [
    "Bd3"
   ],
   "spoken": "The accurate move isn't the flashy one — the quiet bishop to d3. Not f4, which lets ...Bxc3 and ...d6 turn that pawn into a liability and hampers our own Bg5; and not Bc4, which leaves e4 loose.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
    "the accurate, unflashy Bd3"
   ]
  },
  {
   "ply": 14,
   "t": 205,
   "fen": "r1bqk2r/pppp1ppp/5n2/4b3/4P3/2NB4/PPP2PPP/R1BQK2R w KQkq - 2 8",
   "line": [
    "Nf6"
   ],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 15,
   "t": 210,
   "fen": "r1bqk2r/pppp1ppp/5n2/4b3/4P3/2NB4/PPP2PPP/R1BQ1RK1 b kq - 3 8",
   "line": [
    "O-O"
   ],
   "spoken": "We castle — and there's no Greek gift here, since the g4 square is covered.",
   "kind": "main"
  },
  {
   "ply": 16,
   "t": 215.5,
   "fen": "r1bq1rk1/pppp1ppp/5n2/4b3/4P3/2NB4/PPP2PPP/R1BQ1RK1 w - - 4 9",
   "line": [
    "O-O"
   ],
   "spoken": ""
  },
  {
   "ply": 17,
   "t": 308,
   "fen": "r1bq1rk1/pppp1ppp/5n2/4b1B1/4P3/2NB4/PPP2PPP/R2Q1RK1 b - - 5 9",
   "line": [
    "Bg5"
   ],
   "spoken": "The conventional bishop to g5 — better than dropping the knight to e2, which would surrender our grip on d5.",
   "kind": "main"
  },
  {
   "ply": 19,
   "t": 317,
   "fen": "r1bq1rk1/pppp1pp1/5n1p/4b3/4P2B/2NB4/PPP2PPP/R2Q1RK1 b - - 1 10",
   "line": [
    "h6",
    "Bh4"
   ],
   "spoken": "After ...h6 we retreat to h4, and that h6-pawn becomes a hook we'll use later to push f4 open.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": [
    "a pawn hook to lever open the kingside"
   ]
  },
  {
   "ply": 20,
   "t": 327.5,
   "fen": "r1b1qrk1/pppp1pp1/5n1p/4b3/4P2B/2NB4/PPP2PPP/R2Q1RK1 w - - 2 11",
